 [X] Trapping procedure set: settrapparams, currenttrapparams, settrapzone
     (parameters recorded and queryable; no traps are generated, as the
     language leaves in-RIP trapping device-dependent)
 [X] packedarray (built as ordinary arrays), setpacking,
     currentpacking
 [X] setoverprint, currentoverprint (carried to the pdfwrite output; the
